{"body":"## Summary\nBuilds a local, dev-only Review Console to cut item review time from ~2.5 minutes to under 1 minute.\n\n### Key Features\n1. **Pinned Stimulus**: Renders reading passages once in a persistent left panel while iterating through related questions.\n2. **Keyboard-First Workflow**: \\^G\\ (approve), \\\r\\ (reject), \\\u000b\\ (revise), \\\n\\ / \\p\\ (navigate), \\e\\ (quick note focusing without mouse). Live per-item timer with 60-second target indicator.\n3. **Governed CSV Output**: Emits the identical 9-column CSV schema consumed by \\content:record-approvals\\. Never pre-fills decisions or checks; undecided items export blank.\n4. **Pre-Review Batch Summary**: One-page analytics screen providing skill breakdown, difficulty counts, answer-position distribution, and solver vs. semantic review guidance.\n5. **Dev-Only Gate**: Route \\/dev/review-console\\ returns 404 in production or when \\VERCEL_ENV=production\\.\n\n### Scope & Constraints\n- No files modified in PR #52 scope.\n- Zero modifications to \\question-factory/\\ or scholarship branches.\n- No child-serving functions modified.","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T06:59:57Z","authors":[{"email":"45278485+Vishwas2018@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vishwas2018"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T06:59:57Z","messageBody":"…ned stimulus and governed CSV export","messageHeadline":"feat(review-console): dev-only keyboard-first review console with pin…","oid":"6c4b7235e15efca3e2d39c323a4ce721262a332a"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T08:51:57Z","authors":[{"email":"45278485+Vishwas2018@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vishwas2018"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T08:51:57Z","messageBody":"…or-byte binding preservation","messageHeadline":"fix(review-console): load 46-item governed approval batch with byte-f…","oid":"937d5a527bbe54a28d8944fee87532835d1a756b"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T09:00:11Z","aut